<title>ISRAEL: U.S. envoy hails Israel, PLO progress on Hebron.</title>
<headline>U.S. envoy hails Israel, PLO progress on Hebron.</headline>
<dateline>EREZ, Gaza Strip 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. envoy Dennis Ross said Israeli leader Benjamin Netanyahu and Palestinian President Yasser Arafat made &quot;real progress&quot; on Tuesday towards a deal to give Palestinians self-rule in the West Bank town of Hebron.</p>
<p>&quot;We don't have an agreement yet but it's very clear that this was a meeting that was extremely productive,&quot; Ross told reporters. &quot;They have made real progress.&quot;</p>
</text>
